{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3467040/extras/aa3670d31b4aa896087620864f12acf7.avif?t=1773823032\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3467040/extras_big/aa3670d31b4aa896087620864f12acf7.avif?t=1773823032 width=800 height=56 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fulfill your dream of owning and operating your own bookshop. Buy and sell inventory and use the profits to decorate and expand your shop. Build your business from a small boutique shop into a retail empire!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3467040/extras/ee35eeeb570b863f7bd8bdc53ef67812.poster.avif?t=1773823032\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3467040/extras/ee35eeeb570b863f7bd8bdc53ef67812.webm?t=1773823032\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3467040/extras/ee35eeeb570b863f7bd8bdc53ef67812.mp4?t=1773823032\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3467040/extras/1131274c97d409456cba676b6d117736.avif?t=1773823032\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3467040/extras_big/1131274c97d409456cba676b6d117736.avif?t=1773823032 width=800 height=56 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buy and place bookshelves, then fill them with new books, comics, board games, and other items to sell. Run the cash register to earn revenue. As your business grows, hire employees to be cashiers and item stockers so you can focus on expansion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3467040/extras/fb2587b2634aca779edbf14854de5dd9.poster.avif?t=1773823032\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3467040/extras/fb2587b2634aca779edbf14854de5dd9.webm?t=1773823032\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3467040/extras/fb2587b2634aca779edbf14854de5dd9.mp4?t=1773823032\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3467040/extras/5d282aef30d12a9fe8b589169df124a7.avif?t=1773823032\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3467040/extras_big/5d282aef30d12a9fe8b589169df124a7.avif?t=1773823032 width=800 height=56 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expand your reach to new locations around the world. Use your income from established shops to help set up new shops. Travel between shops to manage them and optimize your profits.  Early access will launch with the France and Japan locations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3467040/extras/67c9cc9436786f412da15c236ff5f6ec.poster.avif?t=1773823032\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3467040/extras/67c9cc9436786f412da15c236ff5f6ec.webm?t=1773823032\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3467040/extras/67c9cc9436786f412da15c236ff5f6ec.mp4?t=1773823032\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3467040/extras/9ca9bcd4a7c73f5b0c304c8024a5d521.avif?t=1773823032\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3467040/extras_big/9ca9bcd4a7c73f5b0c304c8024a5d521.avif?t=1773823032 width=800 height=56 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your profits to customize your store. Choose walls and floors. Decorate with rugs, plants, wall art, and more! Create specialized sections for your favorite genre, or build cozy book nooks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3467040/extras/ad160b5901d8b08512ff03878dc18a0c.poster.avif?t=1773823032\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3467040/extras/ad160b5901d8b08512ff03878dc18a0c.webm?t=1773823032\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3467040/extras/ad160b5901d8b08512ff03878dc18a0c.mp4?t=1773823032\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3467040/extras/260f513dd0820a26b2aed704c8334420.avif?t=1773823032\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3467040/extras_big/260f513dd0820a26b2aed704c8334420.avif?t=1773823032 width=800 height=56 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get boxes of used books that may contain rare mythical books. These books have powerful abilities to improve your profits and capabilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3467040/extras/8d2d89fb6394b6018c80017d179c4ac8.poster.avif?t=1773823032\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3467040/extras/8d2d89fb6394b6018c80017d179c4ac8.webm?t=1773823032\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3467040/extras/8d2d89fb6394b6018c80017d179c4ac8.mp4?t=1773823032\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3467040/extras/8757851b5d8a5b4392e46af90927e875.avif?t=1773823032\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3467040/extras_big/8757851b5d8a5b4392e46af90927e875.avif?t=1773823032 width=800 height=56 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adopt a cat to keep you and your customers company every day in the shop. Buy food, a bed, and other items to keep the cat active and happy in the store.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3467040/extras/25aa6b341628ac0b12be03e9ee748517.poster.avif?t=1773823032\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3467040/extras/25aa6b341628ac0b12be03e9ee748517.webm?t=1773823032\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3467040/extras/25aa6b341628ac0b12be03e9ee748517.mp4?t=1773823032\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></s